# soju 0.11.1 in the soju-ergo profile, without bouncer-network capabilities.
# alice-old left and mallory took alice while the upstream was disabled.
S: :bouncer.papo.test 005 * AWAYLEN=390 BOT=B BOUNCER_NETID=1 CASEMAPPING=ascii CHANLIMIT=#:100 CHANMODES=Ibe,k,fl,CEMRUimnstu CHANNELLEN=64 CHANTYPES=# CHATHISTORY=1000 ELIST=U EXCEPTS EXTBAN=,m INVEX :are supported
S: :bouncer.papo.test 005 * KICKLEN=390 MAXLIST=beI:100 MAXTARGETS=4 MODES MONITOR=100 MSGREFTYPES=timestamp NETWORK=ErgoTest NICKLEN=32 PREFIX=(qaohv)~&@%+ SAFELIST STATUSMSG=~&@%+ TARGMAX=NAMES:1,LIST:1,KICK:,WHOIS:1,USERHOST:10,PRIVMSG:4,TAGMSG:4,NOTICE:4,MONITOR:100 TOPICLEN=390 :are supported
S: :bouncer.papo.test 005 * UTF8ONLY WHOX draft/ACCOUNTREQUIRED soju.im/SAFERATE :are supported
S: :ergo.test 221 papo-bouncer +Zi
